<title>USA: Mac Frugal's sets $60 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Mac Frugal's sets $60 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DOMINGUEZ, Calif. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mac Frugal's Bargains-Close-outs Inc said Tuesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to $60 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be made periodically on the open market or in privately negotiated transactions, if and when market conditions warrant it, the company said.</p>
</text>
